Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:44.44,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)\c&HF9DFBD&\1a&H37&\t(1300,1300,\c&HDEE6D3&)\t(2540,2540,\c&HF9DFBD&)}纵使心口刺痛 我仍要高声宣扬
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.57,0:00:50.03,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&}我春日里遇见你
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.03,0:00:54.45,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&\t(1000,1400,\c&H5F4743&\1a&H00&)}为你的夏日风情 心驰神往
